\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Jesus, thou art in heaven
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Hark, we've come to Thee
\par Lay your hands on us
\par So that you bless us all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. That's what you did some day
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In Judea land \tab 
\par In your incarnation
\par When you were on earth
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. So that we children too,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 May draw near to you
\par So to hear your voice that
\par You all, come to Me!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Redeemer who blesses
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Specially, children
\par Now graciously bless us
\par Also cleanse us all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Grant us Holy Spirit
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 So to dwell in us
\par Let us come unto Thee
\par  To be heavenly children.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  We shall sing glorious songs
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  To Thee over there
\par  There, we shall see face to face
\par \pard      Our heavenly Father. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

